<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clan Donate</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>donate &lt;item&gt; clan
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>donate boots clan
</pre>
<p>Sends an item from your inventory straight into your clan chest, from 
anywhere in the world. Any member of a clan can donate; the item lies in 
the chest for anyone of the clan to take, and it is kept when the game 
reboots. The chest takes up to 50 donated items; when it is full, you can't 
donate more until someone takes something out.
</p><p>A container must be empty to be donated. You can't donate while fighting, 
or while standing in one of the town donation rooms. Trash can't be 
donated.
</p><p>Quest items don't belong in a clan chest: some of them are limited in 
number in the world, and a chest found holding them may be emptied, and a 
clan that keeps doing it may be removed.
</p><p>For the clan's secret storage, where only the Master and the 
quartermasters can take things out, see <a cmd='#'>Help Cstore</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Donate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cstore</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cequipment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>